dule seems small but distinct, and based on my experience, 7 mm seems like a good and safe estimate, keeping in mind this is an assessment made through the images provided.\n\nSo, here's my final answer, keeping in mind the required format:\n\nNodule.\nIt presents as a focal, roughly spherical opacity that appears and resolves within a short segment of slices, unlike a continuous tubular vessel.\n7 mm.\n\n\n",
